{"compatibility":"minor","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: minor.

Protected data: `goal_difference`.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

Changes: replaced the prior statement `to_vector(eta_a) ~ normal(0,1)` with `eta_a ~ normal(0,1)` so the sampling statement targets the top-level parameter identifier required by SafeStan. Stan's vectorized normal density over the matrix `eta_a` sums the same elementwise log densities as `to_vector(eta_a)`, so the posterior/log density is unchanged. No data changes were made; all other data are context inputs.
","model_safe_stan":"data {
  int<lower=1> n_teams; // number of teams (20)
  int<lower=1> n_games; // number of games
  int<lower=1> n_weeks; // number of weeks
  array[n_games] int<lower=1> home_week; // week number for the home team
  array[n_games] int<lower=1> away_week; // week number for the away team
  array[n_games] int<lower=1, upper=n_teams> home_team; // home team ID (1, ..., 20)
  array[n_games] int<lower=1, upper=n_teams> away_team; // away team ID (1, ..., 20)
  vector[n_games] goal_difference;    // home_goals - away_goals
  row_vector[n_teams] prev_perf; // a score between -1 and +1

  // out-of-sample predictions for generated quanties block
  int<lower=1> n_games_pred; // number of games
  array[n_games_pred] int<lower=1, upper=n_teams> home_team_pred;
  array[n_games_pred] int<lower=1, upper=n_teams> away_team_pred;
}
parameters {
  real b_prev;                         // regression coefficient of prev_perf
  real<lower=0> sigma_a0;              // teams ability variation
  real<lower=0> tau_a;                 // hyper-param for game-to-game variation
  real<lower=1> nu;                    // t-dist degree of freedom
  real<lower=0> sigma_y;               // score_diff variation
  row_vector<lower=0>[n_teams] sigma_a_raw; // game-to-game variation
  matrix[n_weeks,n_teams] eta_a;         // random component

}
transformed parameters {
  matrix[n_weeks, n_teams] a;                        // team abilities
  row_vector<lower=0>[n_teams] sigma_a; // game-to-game variation
  a[1] = b_prev * prev_perf + sigma_a0 * eta_a[1]; // initial abilities (at week 1)
  sigma_a = tau_a * sigma_a_raw;
  for (w in 2:n_weeks) {
    a[w] = a[w-1] + sigma_a .* eta_a[w];           // evolution of abilities
  }
}
model {
  vector[n_games] a_diff;
  // Priors
  nu ~ gamma(2,0.1);
  b_prev ~ normal(0,1);
  sigma_a0 ~ normal(0,1);
  sigma_y ~ normal(0,5);
  sigma_a_raw ~ normal(0,1);
  tau_a ~ cauchy(0,1);
  eta_a ~ normal(0,1);
  // Likelihood
  for (g in 1:n_games) {
    a_diff[g] = a[home_week[g], home_team[g]] - a[away_week[g], away_team[g]];
  }
  goal_difference ~ student_t(nu, a_diff, sigma_y);
}
generated quantities {
  vector[n_games] goal_difference_rep;
  vector[n_games_pred] goal_difference_pred_rep;

  for (g in 1:n_games)
    goal_difference_rep[g] = student_t_rng(nu, a[home_week[g], home_team[g]] -
                                        a[away_week[g], away_team[g]], sigma_y);
  // predictions for next week's round of games, using final week abilities
  for (g in 1:n_games_pred)
    goal_difference_pred_rep[g] = student_t_rng(nu, a[n_weeks, home_team_pred[g]] -
                                        a[n_weeks, away_team_pred[g]], sigma_y);
}
","data_safe_json":"{"away_team":[1,3,2],"away_team_pred":[1,2,4],"away_week":[2,3,5],"goal_difference":[6.798889680657185,6.505608401573047,3.2440410158293416],"home_team":[3,1,1],"home_team_pred":[2,1,3],"home_week":[1,4,4],"n_games":3,"n_games_pred":3,"n_teams":4,"n_weeks":5,"prev_perf":[3.427834859258679,5.241202563748724,4.932728866095177,6.54614463467411]}","protected_variables":["goal_difference"]}
